  {
   "text": "Spot Bitcoin ETF outflows from Nov 5 to Nov 13, 2026 totalled about $1.91 billion, of which IBIT was $1,416.4 million (roughly 74%), FBTC $268.4 million and GBTC $100.1 million.",
